OL,3,AMPs debate assisted dying bill for
OL,4,AEngland and Wales ahead of new Commons
OL,5,Avote
OL,6,
OL,7,FMPs are debating again proposals to
OL,8,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,9,FWales, ahead of a new Commons vote -
OL,10,Fwatch live at the top of the page
OL,12,FLabour MP Claire Hazelgrove says the
OL,13,Fbill would end the "harmful status quo"
OL,14,Fas she recounts her mother "writhing"
OL,15,Fin pain, while one Tory MP warns of
OL,16,F"grizzly unintended consequences" if it
OL,17,Fwere to pass
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
