OL,3,AMan admits murder of woman missing for
OL,4,A28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman who went missing 28 years
OL,8,Fago, after telling police he disposed
OL,9,Fof her decomposed body months after he
OL,10,Fkilled her.
OL,12,FPatricia Lashley, who was 33 at the
OL,13,Ftime, was last seen near her home on
OL,14,FHall Street, Dudley, in September 1998.
OL,16,FTrevor Dunkley, 66, pleaded guilty to
OL,17,Fher murder and a separate count of
OL,18,Fpreventing her lawful burial at a
OL,19,Fhearing at Wolverhampton Crown Court on
OL,20,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1789127768
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMan admits murder of woman missing for
OL,4,A28 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDunkley's barrister Balbir Singh told
OL,7,FJudge Michael Chambers KC that
OL,8,FLashley's body had never been found,
OL,9,Fand had decomposed after initially
OL,10,Fbeing put in the cellar.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
